{"id": "90010015", "name": "שארית בקוטב פשוט של g/h כאשר h טריגונומטרית – הנוסחה g(z₀)/h′(z₀)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(z)=\\frac{ {{CT:0}} }{ {{CT:1}} }. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את השארית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_{z={{CT:2}}} f(z)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_{z={{CT:2}}} f(z)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">pi</code>, וכפל מסמנים בכוכבית. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">3*pi/7</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f=\\dfrac{g}{h}\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g,h\\)</span> אנליטיות, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(h(z_0)=0\\ne h'(z_0)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(z_0)\\ne 0\\)</span>, יש ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> קוטב פשוט ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z_0\\)</span>, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_{z_0}f=\\dfrac{g(z_0)}{h'(z_0)}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — קוטב פשוט</b><br>כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z_0={{CT:2}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(h(z)={{CT:1}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(h(z_0)=0\\)</span>. הנגזרת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(h'(z)={{CT:3}}\\)</span> שווה ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z_0\\)</span> ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\ne 0\\)</span>, והמונה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(z_0)={{CT:5}}\\ne 0\\)</span>. לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z_0\\)</span> קוטב פשוט.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — השארית</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\operatorname{Res}_{z={{CT:2}}}f=\\frac{g(z_0)}{h'(z_0)}=\\frac{ {{CT:5}} }{ {{CT:4}} }={{CT:6}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "res", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wsg", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">טעות סימן: בדקו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(h'(z_0)={{CT:4}}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "g0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">צריך לחלק ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(h'(z_0)={{CT:4}}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">היעזרו בנוסחה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_{z_0}\\frac{g}{h}=\\frac{g(z_0)}{h'(z_0)}\\)</span> לקוטב פשוט.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["al", "be", "dh", "dh0", "g0", "h", "n", "num", "res", "ty", "wsg", "z0"], "nvariants": 50}